          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir döngünün kodunu tekrarlama sayısını kontrol etmeye, düşmanları <code>1</code> ile <code>10</code> arasında oluşturmak için döngü kullanan bu oyun HUD'si gibi, bir göz atalım.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    min-height: 440px;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    height: 25px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   em,&#xA;   h3,&#xA;   #slider {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   .enemy {&#xA;    display: inline-flex;&#xA;    align-items: center;&#xA;    gap: 8px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&quot;display: inline-block; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;em&gt;Move the input element below&lt;/em&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Enemies to spawn: &lt;span id=&quot;enemiesToSpawn&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div id=&quot;slider&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 25px;&quot;&gt;1 &lt;input min=&quot;1&quot;&#xA;     max=&quot;10&quot; oninput=&quot;spawnEnemies(this.value);&quot; type=&quot;range&quot;&#xA;     value=&quot;3&quot;&gt; 10&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;ol id=&quot;list&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   spawnEnemies(3);&#xA;   &#xA;   function spawnEnemies(enemyCount) {&#xA;    let enemiesToSpawn = document.getElementById(&quot;enemiesToSpawn&quot;);&#xA;    enemiesToSpawn.innerHTML = enemyCount;&#xA;    let list = document.getElementById(&quot;list&quot;);&#xA;    list.innerHTML = &quot;&quot;;&#xA;    let counter = 1;&#xA;    while (counter &lt;= enemyCount) {&#xA;     let item = document.createElement(&quot;li&quot;);&#xA;     item.className = &quot;enemy&quot;;&#xA;     item.innerHTML = &quot;&lt;img src=&quot; + &quot;https://mimo.app/i/bolt.png&quot; + &quot; height=25&gt; Slime Enemy&quot;;&#xA;     list.appendChild(item);&#xA;     counter++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>while</code> döngüsünün tekrarlanma sayısını kontrol etmek için bir sayıya ayarlanmış bir değişkenle başlarız. Bu değişkene <strong>sayaç değişkeni</strong> deriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ardından, koşulda sayaç değişkenini bir sayıyla karşılaştırmak için bir karşılaştırma kullanırız. Bu durumda <code>counter &lt; 4</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>counter</code>, ardından <code>&lt;</code> ve son olarak <code>4</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kod bloğunun içinde koşulun <code>false</code> döndürmesini sağlıyor ve sayaç değişkenini artırarak döngüyü durduruyoruz. <code>counter++</code> ile dene.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"90\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter++</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koşulu değiştirmek, döngüye ne zaman duracağını söyler. Örneğin koşulu <code>counter &lt; 10</code> olarak değiştirebilirsin.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayaç değişkeninin değerini değiştirmek, döngünün ne zaman başlayacağını değiştirir. Örneğin <code>counter</code> değerini <code>5</code> olarak ayarlamak gibi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tüm kod bloğu çalıştığı için kodu yazma sıran konsolun ne göstereceğini etkiler. <code>counter++</code> ifadesini önce yerleştirerek <code>6</code> ile <code>10</code> arasındaki değerleri göster.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"84\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wave &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>counter++;</code>, ardından <code>console.log(\"Wave \" + counter);</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
