            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>counter++</code> ne yapar?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Döngü kod bloğunu her çalıştırdığında <code>counter</code>'ı bir artırır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code> değişkenini oluşturur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Döngü kod bloğunu her çalıştırdığında <code>counter</code>'ı bir artırır.</p></body></html>"
