            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayaç değişkenini oluştur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyNumber = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyNumber &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyNumber + \" /><text value=\"&quot;. Slime Enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" enemyNumber++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>let</code>, ardından <code>enemyNumber</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
