            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>number &lt; 6</code> koşulunu ayarlayarak <code>1</code> ile <code>5</code> arasındaki sayıları görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (number &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" number++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>number</code>, ardından <code>&lt;</code> ve son olarak <code>6</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
